  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aStorageKey\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\8eMarca que `bootstrap()` ya corri\c3\b3. Antes de eso el SA tiene contract\0ainstance pero ninguna rule \e2\80\94 todas las operaciones del usuario fallan.\00\00\00\00\00\0bInitialized\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\d6Address que firm\c3\b3 el `createContract`. Es el \c3\banico que puede llamar a\0a`bootstrap()`. Para Accesly esto es siempre `channels-fund` del backend.\0aEsta storage entry se borra al final de `bootstrap()` (one-shot use).\00\00\00\00\00\08Deployer\00\00\00\00\00\00\00tSHA-256(email || salt) \e2\80\94 usado por el backend para discovery v\c3\ada emailHash.\0aSe actualiza en cada `rotate_signer`.\00\00\00\0fEmailCommitment\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00iAddress del verifier ed25519 \e2\80\94 necesario para reconstruir `Signer::External`\0adentro de `rotate_signer`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fEd25519Verifier\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00CAddress del verifier secp256r1 \e2\80\94 idem para el signer del passkey.\00\00\00\00\11Secp256r1Verifier\00\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\92Emitido cuando `rotate_signer` rota exitosamente al nuevo set de signers.\0aEl backend escucha este evento como audit trail del recovery completado.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dSignerRotated\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0esigner_rotated\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dsmart_account\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11new_owner_ed25519\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_secp256r1_pubkey\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00A\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_email_commitment\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13SmartAccountV3Error\00\00\00\00\07\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\12AlreadyInitialized\00\00\00\00#)\00\00\00J`bootstrap` requiere auth del deployer que se registr\c3\b3 en el constructor.\00\00\00\00\00\15NotAuthorizedDeployer\00\00\00\00\00#*\00\00\00:Operaci\c3\b3n sobre un SA que a\c3\ban no llam\c3\b3 a `bootstrap()`.\00\00\00\00\00\12NotYetBootstrapped\00\00\00\00#+\00\00\00@`rotate_signer` no encontr\c3\b3 un signer existente que reemplazar.\00\00\00\19SignerNotFoundForRotation\00\00\00\00\00#\8d\00\00\00\8a`rotate_signer_partial` recibi\c3\b3 `rule_ids` vac\c3\ado. El caller debe pasar\0aal menos un rule para rotar; si no hay nada que rotar, no llamar.\00\00\00\00\00\15EmptyRuleIdsInPartial\00\00\00\00\00#\8e\00\00\00G`rotate_signer_partial` recibi\c3\b3 un rule_id que no existe en la wallet.\00\00\00\00\10RuleIdOutOfRange\00\00#\8f\00\00\00\d1`rotate_signer_partial` intent\c3\b3 tocar una regla que no es biometric-tx,\0aadmin-cfg ni sep10-auth. Esas se rotan aparte con `add_signer/remove_signer`\0afirmado por admin-cfg \e2\80\94 no las mueve el flow de recovery.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10RuleNotRotatable\00\00#\90\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\e3Executes a function call on a target contract from within the smart\0aaccount context.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `target` - The address of the contract to call.\0a* `target_fn` - The function name to invoke on the target contract.\0a* `target_args` - Arguments to pass to the target function.\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then calling\0a`e.invoke_contract()`.\00\00\00\00\07execute\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06target\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09target_fn\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0btarget_args\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07upgrade\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dnew_wasm_hash\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08operator\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Completa la inicializaci\c3\b3n del Smart Account: persiste signers + verifiers\0aen storage e instala las 3 context rules base (biometric-tx \c3\97 N + admin-cfg\0a+ sep10-auth).\0a\0aSolo puede llamarse UNA VEZ y solo por el `deployer` registrado en\0a`__constructor`. Tras el \c3\a9xito, el storage de `Deployer` se borra y el\0aflag `Initialized` se setea \e2\80\94 futuras llamadas a `bootstrap` panican.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `owner_ed25519`         \e2\80\94 Pubkey ed25519 reconstruida F1+F2+F3 (32 bytes).\0a* `email_commitment`      \e2\80\94 `sha256(email || salt)` (32 bytes).\0a* `secp256r1_pubkey`      \e2\80\94 Pubkey del passkey (65 bytes uncompressed).\0a* `ed25519_verifier`      \e2\80\94 Address del Ed25519Verifier compartido.\0a* `secp256r1_verifier`    \e2\80\94 Address del Secp256r1Verifier compartido.\0a* `spending_limit_policy` \e2\80\94 Address del SpendingLimitPolicy compartido.\0a* `spending_limit_params` \e2\80\94 XDR `SpendingLimitAccountParams`.\0a* `tx_targets`            \e2\80\94 Vec de SAC addresses para spending-limit.\0aVac\c3\ado \e2\86\92 solo 2 rules base (admin-cfg + sep10-auth); el ba\00\00\00\09bootstrap\00\00\00\00\00\00\08\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0downer_ed25519\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10email_commitment\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10secp256r1_pubkey\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00A\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10ed25519_verifier\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\12secp256r1_verifier\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\15spending_limit_policy\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\15spending_limit_params\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0atx_targets\00\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\acAdds a new policy to an existing context rule, installs it, and returns\0athe assigned policy ID. The policy's `install` method will be called\0aduring this operation.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to modify.\0a* `policy` - The address of the policy contract to add.\0a* `install_param` - The installation parameter for the policy.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::DuplicatePolicy`] - When the policy already\0aexists in the rule.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::TooManyPolicies`] - When adding would exceed\0aMAX_POLICIES (5).\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22policy_added\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[policy_id: u32]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::add_policy`].\00\00\00\0aadd_policy\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06policy\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dinstall_param\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\15Adds a new signer to an existing context rule, returning the assigned\0asigner ID.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to modify.\0a* `signer` - The signer to add to the context rule.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::DuplicateSigner`] - When the signer already\0aexists in the rule.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::TooManySigners`] - When adding would exceed\0aMAX_SIGNERS (15).\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22signer_added\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[signer_id: u32]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::add_signer`].\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aadd_signer\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06signer\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\06Signer\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0c__check_auth\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11signature_payload\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0asignatures\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bAuthPayload\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dauth_contexts\00\00\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\07Context\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\11SmartAccountError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\d1Crea el Smart Account v3 con storage m\c3\adnimo. Solo guarda el `deployer`\0aautorizado para llamar a `bootstrap()`.\0a\0aEsta separaci\c3\b3n deploy/bootstrap es por el cap de `txWriteBytes` de\0aSoroban protocol 27 (132KB). Un constructor que invocara\0a`setup_context_rules` tocar\c3\ada las WASMs de los 2 verifiers (~47KB) +\0ala WASM del SA (~91KB) + storage = ~163KB, sobre el cap. Splitea:\0a- Deploy (`__constructor`): SA WASM + 1 storage entry \e2\86\92 ~95KB \e2\9c\93\0a- Bootstrap: verifiers como readOnly + rules/signers data \e2\86\92 ~30KB \e2\9c\93\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `deployer` \e2\80\94 Address que firm\c3\b3 el `createContract`. Es el \c3\banico que\0apuede llamar `bootstrap()` para completar la inicializaci\c3\b3n. En el\0abackend de Accesly esto es siempre `channels-fund`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08deployer\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\02Retrieves the global registry ID for a policy.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `policy` - The policy address to look up.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::PolicyNotFound`] - When the policy is not\0aregistered in the global registry.\00\00\00\00\00\0dget_policy_id\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06policy\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\faRetrieves the global registry ID for a signer.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `signer` - The signer to look up.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::SignerNotFound`] - When the signer is not\0aregistered in the global registry.\00\00\00\00\00\0dget_signer_id\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06signer\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\06Signer\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\03ZRemoves a policy from an existing context rule and uninstalls it. The\0apolicy's `uninstall` method will be called during this operation.\0aRemoving the last policy is allowed only if the rule has at least\0aone signer.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to modify.\0a* `policy_id` - The ID of the policy to remove from the context rule.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::PolicyNotFound`] - When the policy doesn't exist\0ain the rule.\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22policy_removed\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[policy_id: u32]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::remove_policy`].\00\00\00\00\00\0dremove_policy\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09policy_id\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\02Removes a signer from an existing context rule. Removing the last signer\0ais allowed only if the rule has at least one policy.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to modify.\0a* `signer_id` - The ID of the signer to remove from the context rule.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::SignerNotFound`] - When the signer doesn't exist\0ain the rule.\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22signer_removed\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[signer_id: u32]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::remove_signer`].\00\00\00\00\00\0dremove_signer\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09signer_id\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02~Rota los signers principales del Smart Account en una sola tx at\c3\b3mica.\0a\0aPieza clave del flujo de recovery v2:\0a1. SDK reconstruye seed con F2+F3 (sin device).\0a2. SDK registra un new passkey + genera nuevo Shamir \e2\86\92 F1', F2', F3'.\0a3. SDK firma esta tx con la seed VIEJA (sigue v\c3\a1lida hasta rotate).\0a4. Soroban valida la firma contra `admin-cfg` rule.\0a5. Esta funci\c3\b3n rota:\0a- owner_ed25519 en todas las reglas biometric-tx + admin-cfg\0a- secp256r1_pubkey en sep10-auth\0a- email_commitment en storage\0a6. Emite `SignerRotated` event para audit trail del backend.\0a\0a# Auth\0aRequiere que el Smart Account autorice (via context rule `admin-cfg`).\00\00\00\00\00\0drotate_signer\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11new_owner_ed25519\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_secp256r1_pubkey\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00A\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_email_commitment\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00HDevuelve `true` si `bootstrap()` ya fue llamado y el SA est\c3\a1 operativo.\00\00\00\0eis_initialized\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Creates a new context rule with the specified configuration, returning\0athe newly created `ContextRule` with a unique ID assigned. Installs\0aall specified policies during creation.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_type` - The type of context this rule applies to.\0a* `name` - Human-readable name for the context rule.\0a* `valid_until` - Optional expiration ledger sequence.\0a* `signers` - List of signers authorized by this rule.\0a* `policies` - Map of policy addresses to their installation parameters.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::NoSignersAndPolicies`] - When both signers and\0apolicies are empty.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::TooManySigners`] - When signers exceed\0aMAX_SIGNERS (15).\0a* [`SmartAccountError::TooManyPolicies`] - When policies exceed\0aMAX_POLICIES (5).\0a* [`SmartAccountError::DuplicateSigner`] - When the same signer appears\0amultiple times.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::PastValidUntil`] - When valid_until is in the\0apast.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::MathOverflow`] - When the context rule, si\00\00\00\10add_context_rule\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ccontext_type\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0fContextRuleType\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04name\00\00\00\10\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bvalid_until\00\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07signers\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\06Signer\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08policies\00\00\03\ec\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bContextRule\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01eRetrieves a context rule by its unique ID, returning the\0a`ContextRule` containing all metadata, signers, and policies.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The unique identifier of the context rule to\0aretrieve.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10get_context_rule\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bContextRule\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\021Cierra un flow de rotate particionado \e2\80\94 pieza 2 (final) de v3.2.0.\0a\0aPersiste `email_commitment` en storage y emite `SignerRotated` con el\0aset completo de nuevos identificadores. NO toca ning\c3\ban rule; asume que\0alas calls previas a `rotate_signer_partial` ya cubrieron todas las\0arules que ten\c3\adan el signer viejo.\0a\0a# Auth\0aRequiere admin-cfg firmado por el **nuevo** owner ed25519 (las calls\0aprevias ya migraron al menos la rule admin-cfg). Este check funciona\0acomo safety net contra un caller que llame `finalize_rotation` sin\0ahaber ejecutado el batch completo.\00\00\00\00\00\00\11finalize_rotation\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11new_owner_ed25519\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_secp256r1_pubkey\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00A\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_email_commitment\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\a7Removes a context rule and cleans up all associated data. This function\0auninstalls all policies associated with the rule and removes all stored\0adata including signers, policies, and metadata.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to remove.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22context_rule_removed\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::remove_context_rule`].\00\00\00\00\13remove_context_rule\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00zDevuelve el `email_commitment` actual (\c3\batil para auditor\c3\ada off-chain).\0aDevuelve zeros si el SA a\c3\ban no se bootstrappe\c3\b3.\00\00\00\00\00\14get_email_commitment\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Rota el signer de un subconjunto de rules \e2\80\94 pieza 1 del flow de recovery\0aparticionado (v3.2.0, Fase T).\0a\0aDise\c3\b1ada para wallets con 4+ context rules donde el `rotate_signer`\0aat\c3\b3mico excede el cap P27 de `txWriteBytes` (132KB). El caller (SDK)\0aenumera las rules on-chain, agrupa por batches que caben bajo el cap\0a(~2-3 rules por batch en la pr\c3\a1ctica), y llama esta funci\c3\b3n N veces.\0aTermina con `finalize_rotation` para persistir `email_commitment` y\0aemitir `SignerRotated`.\0a\0a# Estado intermedio\0aDurante la ventana entre el primer `rotate_signer_partial` y el\0a`finalize_rotation`, algunas rules apuntan al signer viejo y otras al\0anuevo. Ambos pueden firmar mientras dure ese estado \e2\80\94 es responsabilidad\0adel SDK completar el flow en el mismo commit l\c3\b3gico. Si el SDK falla\0aentre calls, retry hasta cerrar la rotaci\c3\b3n con `finalize_rotation`.\0a\0a# Auth\0aRequiere admin-cfg. La primera call se autoriza con el signer viejo;\0alas siguientes tambi\c3\a9n, mientras `admin-cfg` a\c3\ban tenga el viejo. Si el\0acaller decidi\c3\b3 incluir `a\00\00\00\15rotate_signer_partial\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08rule_ids\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11new_owner_ed25519\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14new_secp256r1_pubkey\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00A\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\8bRetrieves the number of all context rules, including expired rules.\0aDefaults to 0.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\00\00\00\00\17get_context_rules_count\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\d8Updates the name of an existing context rule, returning the updated\0a`ContextRule` with the new name.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to update.\0a* `name` - The new human-readable name for the context rule.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22context_rule_meta_updated\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[name: String, context_type: ContextRuleType, valid_until:\0aOption<u32>]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::update_context_rule_name`].\00\00\00\18update_context_rule_name\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04name\00\00\00\10\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bContextRule\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03\5cUpdates the expiration time of an existing context rule, returning the\0aupdated `ContextRule` with the new expiration time.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a\0a* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\0a* `context_rule_id` - The ID of the context rule to update.\0a* `valid_until` - New optional expiration ledger sequence. Use `None`\0afor no expiration.\0a\0a# Errors\0a\0a* [`SmartAccountError::ContextRuleNotFound`] - When no context rule\0aexists with the given ID.\0a* [`SmartAccountError::PastValidUntil`] - When valid_until is in the\0apast.\0a\0a# Events\0a\0a* topics - `[\22context_rule_meta_updated\22, context_rule_id: u32]`\0a* data - `[name: String, context_type: ContextRuleType, valid_until:\0aOption<u32>]`\0a\0a# Notes\0a\0aDefaults to requiring authorization from the smart account itself\0a(`e.current_contract_address().require_auth()`) and then delegating to\0a[`storage::update_context_rule_valid_until`].\00\00\00\1fupdate_context_rule_valid_until\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fcontext_rule_id\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bvalid_until\00\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bContextRule\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\15UpgradeableStorageKey\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dSchemaVersion\00\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00*Event emitted when the merkle root is set.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07SetRoot\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\08set_root\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04root\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00'Event emitted when an index is claimed.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aSetClaimed\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0bset_claimed\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05index\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\16MerkleDistributorError\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\1bThe merkle root is not set.\00\00\00\00\0aRootNotSet\00\00\00\00\05\14\00\00\00'The provided index was already claimed.\00\00\00\0